  "description": "This package contains a common assembly used by Devart’s dotConnect product line - a line of powerful ADO.NET providers for databases and cloud applications.\n\ndotConnect product line offers enhanced database connectivity solutions built over ADO.NET architecture and a development framework with advanced support for ORMs, such as Entity Framework and EF Core. Our ADO.NET providers are a complete solution for developing DB-related applications and web sites. They introduce new approaches for designing a data access layer and boosts the productivity of database application development.",
